--TEST--
a class constant's own declaration highlights the read of it three lines below, and not itself, which is what makes an unread constant answer nothing here, `rule:ide/five-features-are-one-reference-index`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Cart
{
    public const int LI<|>MIT = 10;
}

echo Cart::LIMIT;
--REQUEST--
documentHighlight
--EXPECT--
case.nvs:7:12
